WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.343
Orchard Core workflows automate work without code.

00:00:04.343 --> 00:00:08.104
The AI features add two tasks that ask an AI model for an

00:00:08.104 --> 00:00:13.417
answer, and four events that start a workflow when something happens in an AI chat.

00:00:13.417 --> 00:00:18.133
This video builds a workflow that summarizes every chat when it ends, and

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:20.700
explains the outcomes and the events.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.029
Two tasks ask an AI model for an answer:

00:00:28.029 --> 00:00:31.884
one that uses an AI profile, and one that sets up the model

00:00:31.884 --> 00:00:34.850
and the instructions inside the task itself.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:40.115
Four events start a workflow when something happens in an AI chat:

00:00:40.115 --> 00:00:44.693
a chat closes, a field is collected, all fields are collected, or a

00:00:44.693 --> 00:00:46.950
closed chat has been analyzed.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.003
Every AI task has three outcomes:

00:00:50.003 --> 00:00:54.314
Done when the AI answered, Drew Blank when the answer is empty, and

00:00:54.314 --> 00:00:56.618
Failed when something went wrong.

00:00:56.618 --> 00:00:58.980
You decide what each one leads to.

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:06.802
Open Design, Workflows, and click Create Workflow.

00:01:06.802 --> 00:01:11.281
Give it a Name, such as Summarize closed chats, and click Save.

00:01:11.281 --> 00:01:14.137
The editor opens with an empty canvas.

00:01:18.328 --> 00:01:19.667
Click Add Event.

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:23.806
Under AI Chat you find the four events that start from a chat.

00:01:23.806 --> 00:01:26.058
Each one has one outcome, Done.

00:01:26.508 --> 00:01:30.668
Add AI Chat Session Closed, which starts when a chat ends.

00:01:30.668 --> 00:01:35.218
Its one field, Profile, can stay on Any profile, or you can pick

00:01:35.218 --> 00:01:39.183
one profile to react only to the chats of that profile.

00:01:39.183 --> 00:01:40.288
Click Save.

00:01:44.498 --> 00:01:51.028
Click Add Task, find AI Completion using Profile under Artificial Intelligence, and click Add.

00:01:52.129 --> 00:01:58.334
Profiles is the AI profile that answers, with its model, instructions, knowledge and tools.

00:01:58.334 --> 00:02:02.556
Result property name is the name the answer is stored under.

00:02:02.556 --> 00:02:07.609
Start it with AI and a dash, so that it does not clash with another task.

00:02:08.072 --> 00:02:11.236
Prompt template is the message sent to the AI.

00:02:11.236 --> 00:02:15.009
You can mix your own text with values from the workflow.

00:02:15.009 --> 00:02:16.043
Click Save.

00:02:16.043 --> 00:02:20.242
The task shows its three outcomes, Done, Drew Blank and Failed.

00:02:24.441 --> 00:02:28.822
On the canvas, drag the task away from the event, then drag from

00:02:28.822 --> 00:02:32.513
the outcome of the event to the task to connect them.

00:02:32.513 --> 00:02:35.141
When the chat closes, the task runs.

00:02:35.594 --> 00:02:40.383
Connect Failed and Drew Blank to something useful, such as a notification to

00:02:40.383 --> 00:02:44.121
an administrator, so that a workflow never stops silently.

00:02:44.121 --> 00:02:46.924
Then click Save, and turn the workflow on.

00:02:51.126 --> 00:02:57.142
The other task, AI Completion using Direct Config, sets up the model right inside the task.

00:02:57.142 --> 00:03:01.298
Its editor has the settings of a chat interaction, over tabs:

00:03:01.298 --> 00:03:07.004
Content, with the prompt, the deployments, the instructions and the tuning values, and

00:03:07.004 --> 00:03:09.175
Capabilities, with the tools.

00:03:09.175 --> 00:03:13.206
A Knowledge tab appears when the knowledge features are on.

00:03:17.406 --> 00:03:22.104
AI Chat Session Closed starts when a chat ends, because the AI detected

00:03:22.104 --> 00:03:27.656
a goodbye, or because the visitor stopped replying for the profile's inactivity time.

00:03:28.406 --> 00:03:33.051
AI Chat Session Field Extracted starts when the AI collected a value for

00:03:33.051 --> 00:03:37.576
one of the profile's data extraction fields, such as an email address.

00:03:38.326 --> 00:03:44.634
AI Chat Session All Fields Extracted starts when every data extraction field has a value.

00:03:44.634 --> 00:03:46.626
It starts once per chat.

00:03:47.376 --> 00:03:52.530
AI Chat Session Post-Processed starts when the AI finished analyzing a closed chat

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:57.216
with the profile's post-session tasks, such as a summary or a disposition.

00:04:01.416 --> 00:04:03.425
Send new leads to sales.

00:04:03.425 --> 00:04:09.184
The assistant collects a visitor's name, email and question, and when all fields

00:04:09.184 --> 00:04:13.536
are extracted, an email task sends them to your sales team.

00:04:14.286 --> 00:04:16.068
Summarize closed chats.

00:04:16.068 --> 00:04:20.738
A post-session task writes a short summary, and a workflow saves it or

00:04:20.738 --> 00:04:23.626
sends it when the chat is post-processed.

00:04:24.376 --> 00:04:26.152
Tag incoming requests.

00:04:26.152 --> 00:04:31.227
A direct config task answers with one word, Sales, Support or Billing, and

00:04:31.227 --> 00:04:34.526
the workflow routes the request on the answer.

00:04:36.526 --> 00:04:41.233
AI tasks and chat events turn what visitors say into automatic work.

00:04:41.233 --> 00:04:42.886
Thanks for watching.

